	<!-- Export compliance. false = the app uses no non-exempt encryption.
	     All of our crypto is either HTTPS through the OS networking stack
	     (Supabase over URLSession) or hashing (SHA-256 via the Dart
	     `crypto` package, used for content addressing and OTP digests) —
	     encryption built into the operating system, plus hashing, is
	     exempt from export documentation. We ship no proprietary cipher.
	     Declaring it here rather than answering the App Store Connect
	     questionnaire on every upload also stops builds from getting
	     stuck in "Missing Compliance". -->
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
